	(text "Define \n- C_{L} as Y_{1}'s load capacitance\n- C_{S} as stray capacitance\n- C_{51} ,C_{52} as capacitance which are installed on both side of Y_{1}. \n\nYou can calculate with equalment below.\nC_{L} = {(C_{1} × C_{2}) / (C_{1} + C_{2})} + C_{S}\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 420.37 200.914 0)
